------------------------------

  Programm             Image                              Lizenz
  -------------------  ---------------------------------  ------------
  Headscale            docker.io/headscale/headscale      BSD-3-Clause
  LiveKit Server       docker.io/livekit/livekit-server   Apache-2.0
  Caddy                docker.io/library/caddy            Apache-2.0
  Python (Grundlage    docker.io/library/python           PSF-2.0, dazu Debian-Pakete
   der Zentrale)        (3.13-slim)                       unter ihren jeweiligen Lizenzen

  Quellen:
    Headscale:  https://github.com/juanfont/headscale
    LiveKit:    https://github.com/livekit/livekit
    Caddy:      https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy
    Python:     https://github.com/docker-library/python


